      "content": "that makes sense, build the legal paper trail first. once they respond—and if they try to dodge the question or claim they don't recognize my lineage—i'll need to move to the next phase of asserting control. if i decide to establish my own sovereign council to handle all 'diplomatic affairs' and legal matters for the house, how should i structure its charter so it's viewed as a legitimate governing body rather than just a private organization? i want the charter to state that the council holds the ultimate authority on all matters concerning the Thorne estate and its residents.",
